WEBVTT

00:12:58.816 --> 00:13:02.168
te performoj akordin final me mua.

00:13:02.168 --> 00:13:15.097
(Muzike)

00:13:15.128 --> 00:13:20.906
(Duartrokitje)

00:13:20.906 --> 00:13:25.263
Faleminderit. Besoj se ju shikoni se sa

00:13:25.263 --> 00:13:27.944
shume kjo pjese e trupit qe nuk e prek instrumentin

00:13:27.944 --> 00:13:31.310
ne fakt ndihmon me performancen e muzikes.